# Imported Terminal-Bench Harbor task fixtures (solution scripts, generated
# CSVs, instruction.md, Dockerfiles, etc.) preserve the exact bytes of the
# upstream task definitions. Trailing whitespace and missing-final-newline
# can carry semantic meaning for `cat`/`diff`-driven tests, and cleanup risks
# changing rollout outputs. Exempt this subtree from `git diff --check` so
# CI / review gates pass without rewriting upstream fixtures.
environments/terminal_bench/tasks/** -whitespace
